OL,5,G0100 The Welsh Roots of Country
OL,6,     FWhen Al Lewis travelled to
OL,7,     FNashville in 2012 to record an
OL,8,     Falbum, he discovered that the
OL,9,     FWelsh have played a far greater
OL,10,     Frole in shaping country and
OL,11,     FAmericana music than many realise.
OL,12,G0129 Game Tracks with Alex Humphreys
OL,13,     FUncovering the power of video game
OL,14,     Fmusic, Alex Humphreys and guests
OL,15,     Fexplore soundtracks and personal
OL,16,     Ffavourites, revealing how dynamic
OL,17,     Fscores shape emotion, storytelling
OL,18,     Fand culture.
